      "properties": {
        "reported": true,
        "property_type": "magnetic",
        "summary": "Dy6 complex 1 is an SMM. χMT at 300 K is 84.8 cm3 K mol−1 (expected 85.02 for six uncoupled DyIII). χMT decreases to 68.6 cm3 K mol−1 at 2 K. Magnetization reaches 30.9 μB at 1.9 K and 7 T without saturation; M vs H/T curves do not superimpose. Zero-field ac data show frequency-dependent χ″ below 30 K and two Arrhenius regimes (Δ = 5.6 and 37.9 K; τ0 = 4.2×10−5 and 3.8×10−6 s). Applied dc fields have little effect on the dynamics above 1.9 K.",
